messages[16]{user,text}:
  user_2,[00:00] Good morning, Sneha. This is Anjali from First Guard Brokers. Am I speaking with Ms. Roy?
  user_1,[00:05] Uh, yeah... hi Anjali. Yes, this is Sneha.
  user_2,[00:10] Thanks. I'm calling about your auto policy with DCoders. I see it’s set to expire on 15/09/2026. [sighs]
  user_1,[00:15] Oh... already? I thought I had more time.
  user_2,[00:20] Yeah, the system shows the coverage ended yesterday. I wanted to let you know before you hit the road.
  user_1,[00:25] Uh, what happens now? Do I have to... like, get a new policy?
  user_2,[00:30] Exactly. We can renew it today, or you could switch to a different plan. Any thoughts?
  user_1,[00:35] I... I need to check my budget. Can you send me the renewal quote? --
  user_2,[00:38] Sure, I can email you the quote right after this call. Also, if you renew now, you’ll avoid a lapse fee.
  user_1,[00:42] Okay, that sounds good. [typing]
  user_2,[00:45] Great. Just to confirm, your vehicle is a 2020 Honda Civic, right?
  user_1,[00:48] Yes, that's correct.
  user_2,[00:52] Perfect. I’ll process the renewal and send the documents. Expect an email by 09:55.
  user_1,[00:55] Thanks, Anjali. Appreciate the help.
  user_2,[00:58] You’re welcome! Let me know if you have any questions later. Have a safe day.
  user_1,[01:00] Will do. Bye.